WEBVTT

00:00:00.750 --> 00:00:03.230
Your next class starts with the details in

00:00:03.230 --> 00:00:06.710
your invitation. Check the topic, date,
time zone,

00:00:07.010 --> 00:00:07.790
and joining link.

00:00:08.390 --> 00:00:10.330
When it is time, use that link.

00:00:10.910 --> 00:00:12.370
You can also sign in to the Academy

00:00:12.370 --> 00:00:14.910
and open My classroom to find your
scheduled

00:00:14.910 --> 00:00:17.430
class. If a class changes, compare the
latest

00:00:17.430 --> 00:00:20.090
invitation update with the current
classroom details.

00:00:20.890 --> 00:00:23.470
Always check the time zone before making
your

00:00:23.470 --> 00:00:24.750
plans. Need help?

00:00:25.750 --> 00:00:27.530
Open Alex and choose Academy team.

00:00:27.530 --> 00:00:30.770
Leave your question, then return to your
class details.

